# Vendored from github.com/pbakaus/impeccable (see VENDORED.md).
# Same rule as upstream's root .gitattributes: cmd.exe needs CRLF batch files,
# and storing them normalized keeps our blobs identical to upstream's.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# Upstream files stay byte-identical, so `git diff --check` skips them
# (a few reference docs carry trailing spaces). Our own files stay checked.
* -whitespace
VENDORED.md whitespace
.gitattributes whitespace
